\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{Normalization operator and placement are separate choices}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{architecture}

\p{Ba et al. define layer normalization in \citet{Section 3}{ba2016layer}.
The original Transformer applies it after residual addition in
\citet{Section 3.1}{vaswani2017attention}. Xiong et al. distinguish
post-normalized and pre-normalized Transformers in
\citet{Section 3.3}{xiong2020layer}. We separate the operator from its
placement because either coordinate can change while the other is held fixed.}

\p{A later stability statement must therefore name both choices. A result
about the normalization formula alone does not determine the residual path.}
